  "definitions": {
    "E01": "Direct authenticated Driver contention latency after preconnection; quantiles include expected conflicts. N=1 has only three observations across resets.",
    "E02": "Authenticated Gateway POST /trips; finite real Rider cohort, no fleet, real terminal no-driver closure. Request rate is not completed-ride throughput.",
    "E03": "Stored creation proxy is publish-start to PostgreSQL row created_at, not commit/ACK/full-workflow latency. Reported completed-delivery rate uses exact broker ACK counts and the entire observation interval, including management-statistics visibility delay. Prometheus processing histograms use their declared sliding windows and are supporting telemetry, not a separate per-message latency claim."
  }
